  "synopsis": "The film features three distinct segments, each with its own unique setting and premise, blending together into a single cohesive anthology. The first segment, titled Æliens, follows an alien girl who teams up with a space agency civil servant on a frantic search for friends.\n\nFollowing that is Yoroshiku★Shoujo, a chaotic battle royale narrative that centers on a group of girls competing in a fierce game known as \"Queen of Butterfly.\"\n\nThe final story, Nocturn: En Cette Nuit Grotesque, chronicles the journey of a pureblood vampire and three girls who managed to survive by becoming infected after she fed on them.",
